  "body": "For purposes of https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#concept-bc-script should scripting be considered enabled in a document which has \"script-src 'none'\" CSP delivered via HTTP headers?  It seems like it would be nice if `<noscript>` tags in such a page \"worked\".\r\n\r\nNote that making this work for CSP delivered via `<meta>` is probably out of scope and undesirable anyway, since some scripts could have run before that `<meta>` was parsed.\r\n\r\n@mikewest @annevk ",
